From 286c6da1d6ed3f9d75ca2d7fff59fc467153d5f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 27 May 2026 06:08:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add dynamic cycling assessment for AROM (non-HOC)

Replace the static center-based ROM capture with a 5-cycle dynamic
approach for FPS/WFE/WURD. The patient cycles through their natural
range; left/right extremes are tracked continuously (running min/max
per directional segment), and a rest position is computed as the
midpoint of the last completed cycle. HOC, PROM, and APROM paths
are untouched.

https://claude.ai/code/session_01AE9fYG1zpN6pJdkDx6WVQf
